@startuml
|Trade Client Serve|
start
:Send trading instruction to CTS;

|Central Trading System (CTS)|
:Receive instruction;
:Analyze instruction;
:Classify into instruction types;

if (Instruction type?) then (Fetch)
  :Fetch requested information;
elseif (Instruction type?) then (Deal with)
  :Apply matching prescripts;
  :Match instructions;
  :Generate deal result message;
elseif (Instruction type?) then (Repeal)
  :Process repeal/cancel instruction;
  :Generate repeal result message;
else (Other)
  :Handle other instruction type;
  :Generate corresponding result message;
endif

:Produce new message(s) for other modules;

fork
  |Network Message Promulgating|
  :Receive message(s) from CTS;
  :Promulgate network message(s);
fork again
  |Trading System Manage (System Manager)|
  :Access CTS information (authorized);
end fork

|Central Trading System (CTS)|
if (System crash?) then (yes)
  |Maintainer|
  :Diagnose crash cause;
  :Fix the system;
  if (New requirements to support?) then (yes)
    :Modify program to fit new requirements;
  endif
  :Apply strategies to prevent overload crashes;
  |Central Trading System (CTS)|
  :Resume processing instructions;
endif

stop
@enduml